      <h1>Release note: 16 tool pages added</h1>
      <div class="blog-post-meta">
        <span class="blog-post-date">March 27, 2026 · corrected August 28, 2026</span>
        <span class="blog-post-tag">tools</span>
        <span class="blog-post-tag">release note</span>
